+  // MoltenVK's synchronous default can wait for a CAMetalDrawable while holding
+  // that queue's host mutex, stalling guest command processing as well. Dispatch
+  // Metal encoding on MoltenVK's ordered queue instead. Vulkan semaphore/fence
+  // ordering remains unchanged. Preserve explicit diagnostic overrides.
